00:16:32,530 --> 00:16:34,150
-两个  -十五个
- Two. - 15.

355
00:16:36,580 --> 00:16:38,070
-什么  -别担心
- What? - Don't worry.

356
00:16:38,070 --> 00:16:40,170
我又不要求你一个人生完
I don't expect you to bear them all.

357
00:16:40,170 --> 00:16:43,440
我们可以租用一个合适的子宫
I'm sure we can find a suitable uterus to rent.

358
00:16:44,730 --> 00:16:46,470
-才怪  -别想
- No! - Uh-uh!

359
00:16:47,960 --> 00:16:49,310
我们才没有指你呢
We weren't thinking about you.

360
00:16:49,310 --> 00:16:50,760
绝对没有
Of course not.

361
00:16:50,770 --> 00:16:52,300
我要去厨房了
I am going to the kitchen.

362
00:16:52,300 --> 00:16:53,780
要给你们带吃的吗
Can I get anybody anything?

363
00:16:53,780 --> 00:16:55,040
佩妮  来杯牛奶
Penny, nice glass of milk

364
00:16:55,040 --> 00:16:57,220
再加复合维他命如何
and a multivitamin?

365
00:17:08,420 --> 00:17:09,660
同志们
Guys.

366
00:17:10,380 --> 00:17:11,340
同志们  快醒醒
Guys, wake up.

367
00:17:11,340 --> 00:17:12,450
悲惨的消息
Terrible news.

368
00:17:12,460 --> 00:17:13,740
我的天  怎么了
Oh, my God. What, what, what?

369
00:17:13,750 --> 00:17:14,590
是宝宝出事了吗
Is it the baby?

370
00:17:14,590 --> 00:17:16,200
不  不是  我们算错了
No. No, no, we miscalculated

371
00:17:16,200 --> 00:17:17,870
尚未分配的装甲部队数
our unassigned armor class units.

372
00:17:17,870 --> 00:17:19,550
我们得重新开始玩了
We need to start over.

373
00:17:20,470 --> 00:17:21,150
什么
What?

374
00:17:21,150 --> 00:17:22,490
不  不是从头开始
Oh, no, no, no, not from the beginning.

375
00:17:22,490 --> 00:17:24,850
只是从坦克行动开始
Just from when the tanks started moving.

376
00:17:24,850 --> 00:17:26,870
那已经是5小时之前的事了
That was five hours ago.

377
00:17:26,870 --> 00:17:29,400
不  那是2小时之前的事
Mm, no. No, that was two hours ago.

378
00:17:29,400 --> 00:17:31,460
只是感觉像过了5小时
It only feels like five.

379
00:17:32,290 --> 00:17:33,140
几点了
What time is it?

380
00:17:33,140 --> 00:17:34,630
快两点半了
It's almost 2:30.

381
00:17:34,630 --> 00:17:35,980
你们不觉得他们该打电话来了吗
Don't you think we should've heard something?

382
00:17:35,980 --> 00:17:37,160
我想他们没事的
I'm sure they're fine.

383
00:17:37,160 --> 00:17:38,730
我要打给他们
I'm calling them.

384
00:17:42,950 --> 00:17:44,160
嘿  你们还好吧
Hey, everything okay?

385
00:17:44,160 --> 00:17:48,020
很好  宝宝大概一个小时前出生了
Yeah! The baby was born about an hour ago.

386
00:17:48,150 --> 00:17:50,790
老兄  你为什么没打给我
Dude, why didn't you call me?!

387
00:17:51,170 --> 00:17:53,570
如果在见到我儿子的第一个瞬间
The only way I would see my son for the first time

388
00:17:53,570 --> 00:17:55,650
我就想到"得给拉杰打电话"
and immediately think "I need to call Raj"

389
00:17:55,650 --> 00:17:58,310
那一定是因为他是棕色皮肤
is if he came out brown.

390
00:17:59,760 --> 00:18:01,980
色素形成是需要一些时间的
You know, it can take some time for pigment to form.

391
00:18:01,980 --> 00:18:03,660
你的警报还没有解除
You're still not out of the woods.

392
00:18:03,660 --> 00:18:06,600
-恭喜啦  -名字想好了吗
- Congratulations! - Yeah. Hey, what'd you name him?

393
00:18:06,610 --> 00:18:08,120
尼尔·麦克
Neil Michael.

394
00:18:08,120 --> 00:18:10,120
取自于阿姆斯特朗[登月第一人]
Neil for Armstrong,

395
00:18:10,120 --> 00:18:11,650
盖曼[幻想小说家]和戴蒙德[著名歌手]
Gaiman, and Diamond.

396
00:18:11,660 --> 00:18:15,120
叫麦克是因为妮妮那里得缝6针
Michael because Bernie had to get six stitches.

397
00:18:15,590 --> 00:18:17,210
尼尔  这名字好可爱
Neil-- that's cute.

398
00:18:17,210 --> 00:18:19,520
但是我们叫他麦克
But we're calling him Michael!

399
00:18:20,320 --> 00:18:21,420
我没法和她争
I'm not gonna fight her.

400
00:18:21,420 --> 00:18:24,390
这孩子头大如瓜
That kid's head was the size of a cantaloupe.

